{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"You're still a little trouble maker and should watch your mouth though.\" Eloise scolds, although her demeanor is a bit more playful.","created_at":"2021-08-26T14:07:57.476000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880453521143660586","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`Aw, now you sound like Secel. She called me out for cursing in a language she doesn't even know, just from my tone of voice!` they stick their tongue out.","created_at":"2021-08-26T14:08:46.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880453725511102464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"While cursing *is* rude, and you should work on doing that less, I was referring to more *what* you say. Such as calling me out as you did. You may know many languages, but somethings are best left unsaid. Okay?\"","created_at":"2021-08-26T14:11:39.642000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880454452975398942","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
