{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"\"Yes. I'm aware, my situation is did turn out well. But it could just as easily not have. Other times you could get others hurt though, not just yourself. Its not my place to scold though. I just wanted to thank you and give you some food for thought.\" Eloise smiles genuinely, \"on that note how about some *actual* food too?\" She asks as she pulls out a few cookies.","created_at":"2021-08-26T14:16:07.890000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880455578089054288","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861700807626588220","content":"`Yeah, I'm... learning that one.` they take a cookie, and shove it into their mouth whole. `Mmph mrerd.`","created_at":"2021-08-26T14:17:20.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880455881530179634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
